havior unrelated to this task (docs example is aspirational/wrong since 2.x). I won't change `__init__.py` exports — out of scope; PR #886 didn't touch it.\\n\\nSo my test script should use `jwt.api_jwt.PyJWT().decode_complete(...)` or the internal class. Let me redo the test.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"text","text":"Core functionality works. The `jwt.decode_complete` error is pre-existing — it's simply not exported at the top level in 2.8.0 (unrelated to this task). Let me test via the `PyJWT` class:"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_fa432424cae94053b5017f4e","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /testbed && python -c \"\nimport jwt, base64, json\n\ndef b64(d): return base64.urlsafe_b64encode(json.dumps(d).encode()).rstrip(b'=').decode()\n\njwk = jwt.PyJWK({'kty':'oct','k':'c2VjcmV0','alg':'HS256'})\ntoken = jwt.encode({'some':'payload'}, 'secret', algorithm='HS256')\n\n# decode_complete via PyJWT class (not exported at top level in 2.8.0)\nprint('complete:', jwt.PyJWT().decode_complete(token, key=jwk)['payload'])\nprint('complete explicit:', jwt.PyJWT().decode_complete(token, key=jwk, algorithms=['HS256'])['payload'])\n\n# mismatched header alg -> InvalidAlgorithmError\nbad = b64({'typ':'JWT','alg':'HS384'}) + '.' + token.split('.')[1] + '.' + token.split('.')[2]\ntry:\n    jwt.decode(bad, key=jwk)\n    print('ERROR: should have raised')\nexcept jwt.InvalidAlgorithmError as e:\n    print('mismatch raises InvalidAlgorithmError:', e)\n\n# string key without algorithms still raises DecodeError\ntry:\n    jwt.decode(token, 'secret')\nexcept jwt.DecodeError as e:\n    print('string key still requires algorithms:', e)\n\n# PyJWS level\nfrom jwt.api_jws import PyJWS\nprint('jws-level decode:', PyJWS().decode(token.encode(), jwk))\nprint('jws-level decode_complete:', PyJWS().decode_complete(token.encode(), jwk)['payload'])\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"harbor-endpoint","model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":1934,"output":922,"cacheRead":41216,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":531,"totalTokens":44072,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788494555988,"responseId":"gen-1788494556-1h01eeE2XLd95o1KJbXD","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_fa432424cae94053b5017f4e","toolName":"bash","content":[{"type":"text","text":"complete: {'some': 'payload'}\ncomplete explicit: {'some': 'payload'}\nmismatch raises InvalidAlgorithmError: The specified alg value is not allowed\nstring key still requires algorithms: It is required that you pass in a value for the \"algorithms\" argument when calling decode().\njws-level decode: b'{\"some\":\"payload\"}'\njws-level decode_complete: b'{\"some\":\"payload\"}'\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788494579390}]}
