{"type":"message_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"All behaviors work as required. Now let me also test with an RSA key (the JWKS scenario from the task) — the typical use case. The testbed has test keys. Let me test the full JWKS-style flow: encode with RS256 private key, create PyJWK from public JWK, decode with PyJWK without algorithms.\n\nAlso test asymmetric where JWK has no \"alg\" (derived from kty → RS256).","thinkingSignature":"[{\"type\":\"reasoning.text\",\"text\":\"All behaviors work as required. Now let me also test with an RSA key (the JWKS scenario from the task) — the typical use case. The testbed has test keys. Let me test the full JWKS-style flow: encode with RS256 private key, create PyJWK from public JWK, decode with PyJWK without algorithms.\\n\\nAlso test asymmetric where JWK has no \\\"alg\\\" (derived from kty → RS256).\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"text","text":"All behaviors verified. Now let me test the RSA/JWKS scenario from the task (including a JWK without an explicit `alg`, where it's derived from `kty`):"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_74f738ecb9ce454ea863d23f","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"cd /testbed && python -c \"\nimport jwt, json\nfrom jwt.algorithms import RSAAlgorithm\n\nprivkey_pem = open('tests/keys/testkey_rsa.priv').read()\nprivjwk = json.loads(RSAAlgorithm.to_jwk(RSAAlgorithm.prepare_key(privkey_pem)))\npubjwk = {k: v for k, v in privjwk.items() if k != 'd'}\n\ntoken = jwt.encode({'some': 'payload'}, privkey_pem, algorithm='RS256')\n\n# JWK with explicit alg\njwk = jwt.PyJWK({**pubjwk, 'alg': 'RS256', 'kid': 'abc'})\nprint('alg name (explicit):', jwk.algorithm_name)\nprint('decode with PyJWK:', jwt.decode(token, key=jwk, options={'verify_exp': False}))\n\n# JWK without alg (derived from kty -> RS256)\njwk2 = jwt.PyJWK(dict(pubjwk))\nprint('alg name (derived):', jwk2.algorithm_name)\nprint('decode with derived-alg PyJWK:', jwt.decode(token, key=jwk2))\n\n# wrong alg JWK -> rejected\njwk3 = jwt.PyJWK({**pubjwk, 'alg': 'RS512'})\ntry:\n    jwt.decode(token, key=jwk3)\n    print('ERROR: should have raised')\nexcept jwt.InvalidAlgorithmError as e:\n    print('mismatched alg rejected:', e)\n\" 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"harbor-endpoint","model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":1025,"output":451,"cacheRead":43136,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":91,"totalTokens":44612,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788494579395,"responseId":"gen-1788494579-DTfLs6l75i6GW3Hpp0ir","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
